# Florence environment variables — TEMPLATE (safe to commit; contains no secrets)
#
# To use Florence's chat:
#   1. Make a copy of this file in the same folder and name the copy ".env.local"
#   2. Paste your real Anthropic API key after the = sign (no quotes, no spaces)
#   3. Restart the dev server (stop it, then run `npm run dev` again)
#
# ".env.local" is gitignored, so your key stays private and never goes to GitHub.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here
